        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International CP-864, Floral Southwest Cabinet Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Southwest Flower Drop Pull features geometric shapes that are reminiscent of flower petals. Every detail gives this cabinet door pull a southwest feel; and the interesting combination of shapes is aesthetically pleasing to the eye. It is the perfect accent to almost any ranch or southwest style home. Available in 5 finishes in either a 3 inch or a 5 inch center to center.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/southwest-flower-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-206\"><b>CK-206 Southwest Flower Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CP-864 Ornate Petal Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Screw: 1\" long #8 - 32 machine screw.</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/nickel-crab.jpg?v=1704354546\" width=\"497\" height=\"122\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
